```text
USER
 │
 ▼
ACTION REQUEST
 │
 ▼
PERMISSION CHECK
 │
 ├── DENIED → STOP
 │
 ▼
RESOURCE STATE CHECK
 │
 ├── INVALID → STOP
 │
 ▼
REQUIRED AUTHORITY CHECK
 │
 ├── INSUFFICIENT → ESCALATE
 │
 ▼
STEP-UP AUTHENTICATION
 │
 ▼
EXPLICIT CONFIRMATION
 │
 ▼
ACTION EXECUTION
 │
 ▼
RESULT
 │
 ▼
